---
title: Filspresso Next - Request Routing Sequence Diagram
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as Next.js (BFF)
    participant NEST as NestJS Backend
    participant OPA as OPA Policy Engine
    participant P as Python AI Service
    participant J as Java Invoice
    participant K as Kotlin Subscriptions
    participant G as Go Ops
    participant RC as Rust Crypto
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over B,N: Page Navigation (proxy.ts rewrites /coffee → /?page=coffee)
        B->>N: GET /coffee
        N->>N: proxy middleware rewrites to /?page=coffee
        N-->>B: Rendered page shell + security headers (CSP)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over B,NEST: Commerce API (via Next.js BFF proxy)
        B->>N: GET /api/products/[...path]
        N->>NEST: Proxy request (auth + cookie forwarded)
        NEST->>OPA: Authorization check (allow?)
        OPA-->>NEST: Allow / Deny
        NEST->>DB: SQL reads / writes
        DB-->>NEST: Result rows
        NEST-->>N: JSON response
        N-->>B: Rendered data
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over B,P: AI Chat Flow
        B->>N: POST /api/chat
        N->>NEST: Kafelot prompt quota check
        NEST-->>N: Allowed / blocked
        N->>P: /api/chat (semantic or chemistry)
        P->>DB: pgvector similarity search
        P-->>N: AI response payload
        N-->>B: Rendered chat message
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
        Note over B,J: Invoice Download
        B->>N: GET api/orders/:id/invoice
        N->>NEST: Proxy request
        NEST->>J: POST /api/invoices/render
        J-->>NEST: PDF bytes
        NEST-->>N: application/pdf
        N-->>B: Browser download
    end

    rect rgb(248, 255, 255)
        Note over B,K: Subscription Quote
        B->>N: api/subscriptions-engine/quote
        N->>NEST: Proxy
        NEST->>K: POST /api/subscriptions/quote
        K-->>NEST: Quote payload
        NEST-->>N: Quote JSON
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over B,G: Operational Events
        NEST->>G: POST /events/ingest
        G->>G: Write to Redis ops:events list
        Note over NEST,G: mTLS or service assertion token enforced
    end
